---
import Base from '../../components/Base.astro';import {guides} from '../../data/guides.mjs';
export function getStaticPaths(){return guides.map(guide=>({params:{slug:guide.slug},props:{guide}}));}
const {guide}=Astro.props;
---
<Base title={`${guide.title} | CupToGram`} description={guide.description.slice(0,150)} path={`/guides/${guide.slug}/`}><main class="wrap"><article class="content"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/guides/">Guides</a> / {guide.title}</div><span class="eyebrow">Baking guide</span><h1>{guide.title}</h1><p class="lede">{guide.description}</p><p>{guide.body}</p><h2>Practical takeaway</h2><p>Use the measuring method specified in your recipe, choose the correct regional unit system, and use a kitchen scale when precision matters. Conversion values are estimates and can vary with ingredient brand and preparation.</p><p class="small muted">Editorial note: this introductory guide should be reviewed and expanded with reliable sources before launch as a final reference article.</p><a href="/methodology/">Read our measurement methodology →</a></article></main></Base>